   * <code>AccessControlContext.checkPermission(new SocketPermission(host,
   * "resolve"))</code>. Otherwise, the default implementation checks
   * <code>AccessControlContext.checkPermission(new SocketPermission(host
   * + ":" + port, "connect"))</code>. If you override this, call
